## SuperMandi SuperAdmin dashboard (Vite)
##
## IMPORTANT:
## - Vite only loads env vars at dev-server start/build time.
##   After editing .env, restart `npm run dev`.
##
## Cloud backend base URL (public IP or domain)
## IMPORTANT: Must point to API Gateway (port 3000), NOT directly to backend services
## GO-LIVE-SESSION: Use placeholder - actual URL goes in .env.local (not committed)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

## GO-LIVE-SESSION: Authentication is handled via email OTP login.
## No static admin token required - users authenticate with their email
## and receive a time-limited OTP code to verify their identity.

## Build metadata (set by CI — do not set locally)
# VITE_BUILD_SHA=
# VITE_BUILD_TIME=

